WEBVTT

00:00:02.330 --> 00:00:05.170
That's right. I finally understand.

00:00:06.710 --> 00:00:12.420
I still don't know if these feelings are right,
but it doesn't matter.

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:19.250
She may be the strongest scourge
to walk the face of the Earth, but I don't care.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:25.580
If they're going to say that being with you is wrong,
then I don't want to be right.

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:37.920
Vermeil, even if the entire world turns against us,
I'll always stay by your side.

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:40.670
Alto...

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:47.830
I want to be with you forever.

00:00:57.380 --> 00:00:59.580
I love you, Vermeil.

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:03.670
You'll never be alone again. Not on my watch.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.130
Alto...

00:01:56.790 --> 00:01:59.330
Well, all right.

00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:05.080
That was a mythic-level item you just broke, 
but I guess that's what it's gonna take to stop you.

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:10.500
I didn't think I'd have to work this hard, honestly.

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:16.380
I'm kinda into it, though!

00:02:17.130 --> 00:02:21.250
C'mon, let's have our climactic battle!

00:02:42.460 --> 00:02:45.420
Shiro ka kuro kongaragatte gray
Black or white? Tangled up, they turn gray<b></b>

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:48.710
Itsudatte aimai na mama de
Everything always seems so ambiguous<b></b>

00:02:48.790 --> 00:02:54.630
Tayorinaku aruku tonari de hohoenderu kimi
I walk by your side as you smile, helpless<b></b>

00:02:55.130 --> 00:02:58.000
Akogare wa tashika da toshite
Admiration clear as day<b></b>

00:02:58.170 --> 00:03:01.380
Hateshinaku tooku mabushii
Shining out across the endless distance<b></b>

00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:07.080
Chippokena kono genjou Abracada-Boo mahou kakete yo
Cast a spell on this pitiful situation with an Abracada-Boo<b></b>

00:03:07.210 --> 00:03:13.290
Kimi no hitomi no yami ni kakushita
There's a loneliness hidden beneath the darkness in your eyes<b></b>

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:20.040
Samishisa wa yasashii uta de dakishimeteitai no ni
I wish I could embrace it with a gentle song<b></b>

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:24.670
Sekaijuu ga uso datte sawagihajimetatte
Even the whole world starts to shout it's all a lie,<b></b>

00:03:24.670 --> 00:03:27.500
Kimi ga kimi naraba
As long as you are as you are<b></b>

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:33.710
Kirameku kaze o makiokoshi shinjitsu o sakebu
I'll sweep through with a glimmering wind and scream out the truth<b></b>

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:37.290
Sekaijuu ga tsumi datte togameta toshitatte
Even if the whole world yells out that it's a sin,<b></b>

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:40.080
Tatta hitori demo
Even if I'm all on my own<b></b>

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:43.170
Kimi o rikai shi tsuzuketai
I want to keep learning to understand you<b></b>

00:03:43.170 --> 00:03:48.670
I'm on your side mamotte ageru
I'm on your side, I'll protect you<b></b>

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:56.880
<b>TOGETHER</b>

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:30.500
If you broke those chains,
that means you must've seen all the stuff inside.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:41.460
So you've gotta know all the talk about
demons being evil is no joke, but reality.

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:45.250
The powers of destruction
they wield shouldn't be allowed to exist!

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:48.210
Especially when it comes to what SHE can do.

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:54.500
Her powers can do more than
just change the world; she can obliterate it.

00:04:54.750 --> 00:05:00.250
Her powers are so strong and so accursed
that no demon even measures up to her.

00:05:00.830 --> 00:05:09.880
That's why we're going to use those powers
in a much more fun way: to destroy the world!

00:05:10.380 --> 00:05:16.420
And with how you treat him like a sad little pet,
you're only gonna end up hurting yourself!

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:17.250
Quiet.

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:21.250
She's a demon? Who cares?
She's a scourge? Who cares?

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.380
Powers of destruction? Who cares?

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:25.080
No one...

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:28.920
No one sees the REAL Vermeil!

00:05:30.170 --> 00:05:34.330
Do you know that Vermeil loves desserts?

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:38.710
Do you know how Vermeil looks when she smiles?

00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:45.330
Do you know how horrible Vermeil feels
about what happened that day?

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:50.580
I'm not going to let you lay a finger
on my Vermeil ever again!

00:05:51.630 --> 00:05:57.000
All right. I like you getting pissed, it's a good look for you.

00:05:57.630 --> 00:06:03.920
But what're you actually gonna do?!
There's no stopping what's about to happen to you!

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:07.790
Vermeil, let's fight back with everything we have!

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:08.460
Yeah!

00:06:14.170 --> 00:06:15.880
I'd like to see you try!

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:56.290
GO!

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:21.460
Wow. I can't believe you've lasted this long.

00:07:28.540 --> 00:07:29.210
Alto...

00:07:29.210 --> 00:07:29.920
I know.

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:40.630
It's time to stop.

00:07:53.960 --> 00:07:57.000
Wait, what? We're already out of time?

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:06.210
Just by looking at her,
I can tell she's a Platinum Square, too.

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:09.380
Let's go, Iolite.

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:12.250
C'mon, can't we fight just a little longer?

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:13.040
No.

00:08:16.460 --> 00:08:21.080
It's getting quite busy outside.
Prolonging this fight would be fruitless.

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:22.710
Boo.

00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:25.670
Fine, if we have to.

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:30.330
I'll let you guys have this win.

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:38.380
Hold it! What are you guys really after?!

00:08:40.420 --> 00:08:45.630
Who knows? Better keep trying, little Master.

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:51.210
Because I'll be back to finish this battle eventually.

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:53.080
See ya!

00:08:53.080 --> 00:08:54.460
Iolite!

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:01.710
Vermeil...

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:05.250
You're right.

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:10.080
As long as I have you, Vermeil...

00:09:12.170 --> 00:09:15.630
Holy crap! You were there this whole time?!

00:09:17.130 --> 00:09:18.500
Well, of course!

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:23.330
Though you were in quite the precarious situation there.

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:25.000
Fatima?

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:33.790
Live your days by her side.

00:09:34.290 --> 00:09:39.960
You may very well see the entire world turn against you.
Are you prepared for that?

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:40.960
I am.

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:49.040
I'm glad to have entrusted her to you.

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:56.670
Vermeil, I promise to become stronger.
Strong enough to keep you safe.

00:09:57.790 --> 00:10:03.540
I'll be the strongest mage in the entire world
and protect you from everything and everyone.

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:11.040
Mm-hmm.

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:20.080
Take care of Vermeil. She's a very dear friend of mine.

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:21.710
I will.

00:10:25.920 --> 00:10:30.460
Tis nearly time. Go, now.

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:37.830
Fatima...

00:10:38.920 --> 00:10:43.420
You needn't worry, not with him beside you.

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:51.880
Goodbye, Vermeil.

00:11:31.880 --> 00:11:33.540
Wh-what the...?

00:11:41.170 --> 00:11:44.580
She was the mage who sealed you in that book, right?

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:54.580
Fatima...

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:58.000
I see. It was you...

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:09.830
ALTO!

00:12:10.630 --> 00:12:12.210
Are you all right, Alto?!

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:25.000
What's wrong?! Can't fight back
without your demon familiar?!

00:12:28.250 --> 00:12:29.420
You didn't commit!

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:43.920
What are you doing? Stand up!

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:48.380
You'll never be close to beating me
if you continue with this shoddy performance!

00:12:48.540 --> 00:12:50.000
Hold on a sec, Jessica.

00:12:51.960 --> 00:12:53.380
You good to keep going?

00:12:53.380 --> 00:12:54.080
Yeah!

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:59.080
Don't worry, I'll be gentler than Jessica.

00:13:06.290 --> 00:13:10.330
You said you want to get stronger, yeah?
I like your resolve.

00:13:14.630 --> 00:13:20.960
I'll admit, you're pretty incredible.
Already surpassing me in most magical aspects.

00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:22.330
But...

00:13:25.920 --> 00:13:26.920
That's not enough!

00:13:30.420 --> 00:13:34.210
You lack physical strength! You lack tactical know-how!

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:36.380
But most of all...

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:40.630
You lack experience!

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:46.250
You all right?

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:48.540
I-I'm fine!

00:13:49.080 --> 00:13:51.830
Goodness. Weren't you going to be gentle?

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:55.880
Please, I went easy on him.

00:13:55.880 --> 00:14:01.000
Thank you both for taking time
out of your busy schedules to spar with me.

00:14:01.420 --> 00:14:02.710
Could I train with you again sometime?

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:08.830
Why do you want to get stronger so badly?

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:17.500
What I said before aside, you're already plenty strong.

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:19.670
Well...

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:24.540
Live your days by her side.

00:14:24.830 --> 00:14:32.040
You may very well see the entire world turn against you.
Are you prepared for that?

00:14:32.380 --> 00:14:33.130
I am.

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:41.460
Vermeil, I promise to become stronger.
Strong enough to keep you safe.

00:14:42.580 --> 00:14:48.290
I'll be the strongest mage in the entire world
and protect you from everything and everyone.

00:14:54.380 --> 00:14:55.580
I want to protect her.

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:59.080
I don't want to see the person I love cry.

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:07.290
I promised I'd protect her from anyone and everyone.

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:15.790
So I need to be strong enough to do it on my own.

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:19.380
Wh-what's wrong?

00:15:19.380 --> 00:15:23.130
N-nothing, just, uh...

00:15:23.670 --> 00:15:25.080
Huh? Just what?!

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:28.920
I like it! You've got promise!

00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:32.040
Wait, was it weird of me to say all that or something?!

00:15:39.670 --> 00:15:43.830
Chris told me I was lacking a bunch of things.

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:46.130
That's good.

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:51.210
It means I can still get a lot stronger than I am now.

00:15:59.170 --> 00:16:01.170
I keep saying I want to protect her...

00:16:02.380 --> 00:16:07.960
And while we might've won for now,
I can't even hold my own against Chris.

00:16:09.210 --> 00:16:13.460
I should probably brush up
on the basics a whole lot more...

00:16:13.460 --> 00:16:14.380
Alto!

00:16:14.380 --> 00:16:17.540
Oh, sorry! Is everything all right?

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:19.750
Yes, but...

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:28.290
I don't know why, but my chest is throbbing...

00:16:28.540 --> 00:16:32.580
Huh?! That can't be good! Let me see!

00:16:32.580 --> 00:16:35.290
Huh?! A-all right...

00:16:35.630 --> 00:16:40.000
It hasn't been long since that ordeal.
I hope your heart's all right...

00:16:40.170 --> 00:16:42.630
H-hey, Alto?

00:16:42.630 --> 00:16:43.330
Huh?

00:16:44.130 --> 00:16:47.670
Do I... have to show you everything?

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:50.920
Huh? I-I mean, no, of course you don't!

00:16:53.420 --> 00:16:57.670
W-wait, when has Vermeil ever been like this?

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:10.330
Hey, Alto?

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:13.580
Wh-what is it?

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:19.130
All this time, my heart's been racing.

00:17:20.540 --> 00:17:25.830
It started... when you told me you loved me.

00:17:29.170 --> 00:17:29.960
Thank you.

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:39.290
Thank you for accepting me.

00:17:40.380 --> 00:17:45.380
For loving me, despite what I am.

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:50.420
Thank you for holding me close
when I was crying back then.

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:59.000
I love you, more than anything in the whole world, Alto.

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:05.790
I love you, too, Vermeil.

00:18:14.580 --> 00:18:15.580
I love you.

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:34.500
I'm going to get stronger.

00:18:35.710 --> 00:18:37.330
For one person and one person alone.

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:41.250
I'm going to get stronger for Vermeil.

00:18:47.130 --> 00:18:50.710
My, I do quite like the determination on your face.

00:18:55.540 --> 00:19:00.920
These recent incidents have caused harm
to people at our illustrious academy.

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:05.210
Those harmed were all innocent students.

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:11.000
As president of the Student Council,
I cannot stand idly by.

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:15.670
It is the duty of the Student Council
to protect the students of the Academy.

00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:18.210
What say you all?

00:19:19.330 --> 00:19:22.580
I'd say you're getting ahead of yourself,
but I know you won't listen to me.

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:31.960
Still, noblesse oblige. We must do our best
to improve the lives of the students beneath us.

00:19:32.670 --> 00:19:34.750
I follow your gracious lead, Madam President.

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:39.920
It's not just about the students.
We gotta protect all their familiars, too.

00:19:40.210 --> 00:19:46.210
They messed with my Rex. They're gonna pay for that.

00:19:47.710 --> 00:19:48.670
Very well.

00:19:50.670 --> 00:19:53.290
How about you? What say you?

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:58.380
Even I will admit that it will be quite difficult.

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:04.630
We may find ourselves up against
the military or Platinum Squares.

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:09.830
Knowing that, do you still wish to proceed?

00:20:11.210 --> 00:20:12.330
That doesn't matter.

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:17.790
I'll go to the ends of the Earth for Vermeil.

00:20:20.420 --> 00:20:23.040
That's right, because...

00:20:24.460 --> 00:20:26.830
Because I'm Vermeil's master!

00:20:29.750 --> 00:20:34.130
Yes! We passed the Bronze exam!

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:39.670
I was concerned after the incident,
but thankfully, they rescheduled the exam.

00:20:39.830 --> 00:20:41.250
Right?

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:45.130
But seriously, I can't believe YOU passed.
Kind of shocking.

00:20:46.630 --> 00:20:48.000
Of course I passed!

00:20:48.130 --> 00:20:54.040
My secret weapon makes no mistakes.
That's why I got a perfect score on the multiple choice!

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:56.000
I'd expect nothing less from you.

00:20:57.130 --> 00:20:59.790
You freak me out the most, for real.

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:02.920
But whatever, we all passed, so...

00:21:03.670 --> 00:21:05.210
Wait a minute, where's Alto?

00:21:05.710 --> 00:21:07.710
He was just here...

00:21:08.960 --> 00:21:12.250
Dangit! That blasted woman again!

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:20.670
H-hey, Vermeil, we can't keep doing this here...

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:24.250
Why not? You love me, don't you?

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:31.170
W-well, yes, but that has nothing to do with it.

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:38.790
Oh, shush! You're my Master, you're supposed
to give your familiar whatever she wants!

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:47.710
Familiars have served mages since the times of old.

00:21:48.380 --> 00:21:50.880
Sometimes, they bare their fangs...

00:21:51.880 --> 00:21:56.130
Others, they offer their all to their masters.

00:21:57.790 --> 00:22:02.000
Here's to forever, my darling Master.

00:22:15.630 --> 00:22:22.580
Does it get easier with time for the immortal?

00:22:26.000 --> 00:22:33.290
If I was born normal, if I become normal, can I stay close?

00:22:33.880 --> 00:22:38.710
With the children, we link our arms

00:22:39.920 --> 00:22:43.920
Make a circle and sing a song

00:22:44.250 --> 00:22:50.670
Knowing there was no chair for me all along

00:22:50.880 --> 00:22:55.960
You locked me into the dark, I'm your preserved flower

00:22:55.960 --> 00:22:59.630
The world is too slow to understand

00:22:59.630 --> 00:23:03.210
Not all blossoms spark, And spikes may be sharp

00:23:03.330 --> 00:23:07.750
They only want to see the beautiful parts

00:23:07.750 --> 00:23:11.130
Sitting in a shower of scarlet rain

00:23:11.130 --> 00:23:15.460
It all used to be ours, I'm counting the hours

00:23:15.460 --> 00:23:18.920
Hours that stood between us like a river

00:23:18.920 --> 00:23:20.920
Once I crawled through the water

00:23:20.920 --> 00:23:26.460
All I ever knew have become distant past
